1. Project setup
   Next.js app router structure
   Tailwind styling
   Basic layout (navbar, sidebar placeholder)
2. Authentication (NextAuth or Supabase auth)
   Google login working
   Session available everywhere
   Protect /dashboard

👉 Goal:
User can log in and be redirected.

3. Database setup (Supabase)

Create tables:

profiles
events
registrations
reviews

👉 Goal:
You can insert and read data manually.

4. Profile system
   Create profile on first login
   Store:
   id
   email
   role (default: attendee)
   name

👉 Goal:
Every user exists in profiles.

🧠 Phase 2 — Core feature (EVENTS) 5. Event creation (MOST IMPORTANT FEATURE)
Create event form
Server action → Supabase insert
Basic validation
Toasts

👉 Goal:
Organizer can create an event.

6. Events listing page
   Fetch all events
   Display cards
   Basic filtering (optional)

👉 Goal:
Users can browse events.

7. Event detail page
   Single event view
   Show full info
   “Register” button (later used)
   🧠 Phase 3 — Roles & dashboards
8. Role system
   attendee / organizer / admin
   protect actions (like create event)

👉 Goal:
Not everyone can create events.

9. Dashboard layout
   /dashboard
   role-based rendering:
   Organizer dashboard
   Attendee dashboard
   Admin dashboard
10. Sidebar per role
    Different navigation for each role
    🧠 Phase 4 — Interactions
11. Event registration system
    user joins event
    store in registrations table
    prevent duplicate joins
12. “My events” pages
    Organizer: events they created
    Attendee: events they joined
13. Reviews / ratings
    user leaves 1–5 stars
    calculate average rating per event
    🧠 Phase 5 — Polish (this is what makes it portfolio-ready)
14. Toast system (you already started this)
    success / error feedback everywhere
15. Loading states
    skeletons for events
    form loading states
16. UX improvements
    empty states (“No events yet”)
    disable buttons while loading
    better form validation
17. Image upload (Supabase Storage)
    event cover images
    preview before upload
    🧠 Phase 6 — Advanced (optional but impressive)
18. Search & filters
    category filter
    location filter
    date filter
19. Admin dashboard
    users list
    events moderation
    stats
20. Analytics (bonus)
    total events
    total users
    most popular events
